  "description": "Face it, high school's hard. From friends to grades to looks, everything matters. Luckily, Ha Nami's got most of that taken care of. Her grades are at the top of her class, she's got two loyal friends, and she's pretty to boot. Unfortunately, she's also got a curse. One that makes it impossible for her to talk to anyone she likes. Like... \"like\" likes. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
